---
description: Browser deliverables (no Twig in this repository)
globs:
  - "packages/browser/src/**/*.ts"
  - ".size-limit.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

- There are no Twig templates. The public browser assets are the ESM build and the IIFE `beacon.min.js`, attached to
  each GitHub release with checksums.
- Keep the `<beacon-reporter>` attributes backward compatible; document new attributes in `docs/USAGE.md`.
- Respect the size-limit budgets; CSP notes live in `docs/PRIVACY.md`.
